changeSet.sql:
ALTER TABLE plots ALTER COLUMN nominal_size_sqm DROP NOT NULL;

COMMENT ON COLUMN plots.nominal_size_sqm IS
    'What this plot is SOLD AND PRICED as — the number on the deed and the invoice — copied from its tier at creation, never accepted from the request (a caller-supplied size could contradict the tier it is priced by). Nullable ONLY for UNIT_TYPE tiers, where an apartment has no exclusive land area; writing a zero there would fabricate a figure. Kept alongside actual_area_sqm deliberately: a plot sold as 250 sqm may survey at 248.6, and keeping only one loses either the commercial or the physical truth.';
